@startuml l02-read-timing
skinparam monochrome false
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK TC"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12

title 讀週期時序（照影片投影片畫）

scale 50 as 60 pixels

concise "Address" as ADDR
robust "RAS#" as RAS
RAS has High,Low
robust "CAS#" as CAS
CAS has High,Low
concise "Data out" as DOUT

@0
ADDR is {-}
RAS is High
CAS is High
DOUT is {-}

@20
ADDR is "row address"

@80
RAS is Low

@150
ADDR is "column address"

@200
CAS is Low

@320
ADDR is {-}
RAS is High
DOUT is "data out"

@380
CAS is High
DOUT is {-}

@450

highlight 80 to 320 #E8F0FE : RAS# low：latch row、sense 整個 row
highlight 320 to 380 #FEF7E0 : 資料有效

legend bottom
  RAS#、CAS# 都是 active low（拉低 = 動作）。
  ⚠ 影片說「RAS# 放開後資料才出現」。真的非同步 DRAM
  是 CAS# 拉低後一段時間（tCAC）資料就出現，見內文。
endlegend
@enduml
